==English==

===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|head=to [[bust]] [[chops]]}}
# {{idiom}} To [[nag]]; to [[berate]] or [[hound]] in an effort to elicit action.
#: The boss has been '''busting chops''' all day.
#: The boss '''busted''' our '''chops''' all week.
# {{idiom}} To waste someone's time by conversing with them excessively.

===Usage notes===
To bust hump is an alternative version. Other parts of the anatomy can become involved as well, most notably ass and, especially, balls.

